WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.739 --> 00:00:07.223
This page connects the course to your own field of study, whatever you are here to become.

2
00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:14.333
Pick your area of study, or your exact program. Undecided is a real option and has its own write-up.

3
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:23.667
Read the lens first. The Read it this way line gives you one question to carry through the whole course from your field's point of view.

4
00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:34.367
Work the scenario. Each field gets a concrete scenario showing the course ideas operating in that world, plus the transferable skills employers actually name.

5
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:43.828
Follow the week links. Each field points at the two or three weeks that matter most for it, and those links jump straight to the stations.

6
00:00:43.828 --> 00:00:51.927
Write the reflection. One honest paragraph about how this course touches your field is a seed for assignments later.

7
00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:58.851
The graded curriculum is identical for every student. The lens changes examples and framing only.

8
00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:05.523
Where next: Visit a week the page recommends for your field and watch the framing follow you.
